  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the salmon fillet under cold water and pat dry with a paper towel.",
    "Dice the salmon into 1 cm cubes and place in a bowl.",
    "Finely chop the strawberries and add them to the salmon.",
    "Mince the red onion, jalapeno, and cilantro, then stir into the bowl.",
    "Pour the lime juice over the mixture and toss gently to combine.",
    "Add sea salt, black pepper, sugar, and olive oil, mixing until evenly coated.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for 15 minutes to cure the fish.",
    "Serve chilled immediately, garnished with extra cilantro if desired."
